    "text": "In an <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LCR</mi></math> circuit, the resonant frequency is <math><mn>600</mn><mi>&nbsp;Hz</mi></math> and half-power points are at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>650</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math> and <math><mn>550</mn><mi>&nbsp;Hz</mi></math>. The quality factor is",
