  "solution": {
    "text": "In <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LCR</mi></math> series, resonant frequency,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math><br /><br />Frequencies at half power are given as,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>550</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>650</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>550</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>650</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math><br /><br />Quality factor, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>600</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>650</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>550</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>600</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>",
